# Holds every dashboard view long enough to extract stills (see docs/tapes/README).
Output "docs/media/views.mp4"
Source "docs/tapes/_theme.tape"
Source "docs/tapes/_setup.tape"

Hide
Type "weather-outlook Miami --images off" Enter
Sleep 5s
Show
Sleep 4s
Type "2"
Sleep 3s
Type "3"
Sleep 3s
Type "4"
Sleep 6s
Type "5"
Sleep 4s
Type "i"
Sleep 2s
Type "6"
Sleep 3s
Type "7"
Sleep 3s
Type "8"
Sleep 4s
Type "?"
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
Sleep 300ms
